{"seq":3,"slug":"opaque-and-existential-types","title":"不透明类型与存在类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/type-system/opaque-and-existential-types","wordCount":1040,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"不透明类型与存在类型\">不透明类型与存在类型</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Swift 5.1 引入了不透明类型（Opaque Types，<code>some</code>），Swift 5.6 进一步明确了存在类型（Existential Types，<code>any</code>）的语义。这两种机制都用于隐藏具体类型，但在性能、能力和使用场景上有本质区别。理解 <code>some</code> 与 <code>any</code> 的差异是编写高性能 Swift 代码的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    HT[&quot;类型隐藏机制&quot;] --&gt; SOME[&quot;some(不透明类型)&quot;]&#10;    HT --&gt; ANY[&quot;any(存在类型)&quot;]&#10;    SOME --&gt; SC[&quot;编译时确定类型&quot;]&#10;    SOME --&gt; ZO[&quot;零开销抽象&quot;]&#10;    SOME --&gt; HO[&quot;同构集合&quot;]&#10;    ANY --&gt; RC[&quot;运行时确定类型&quot;]&#10;    ANY --&gt; EC[&quot;存在容器开销&quot;]&#10;    ANY --&gt; HE[&quot;异构集合&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    HT[\"类型隐藏机制\"] --&gt; SOME[\"some(不透明类型)\"]\n    HT --&gt; ANY[\"any(存在类型)\"]\n    SOME --&gt; SC[\"编译时确定类型\"]\n    SOME --&gt; ZO[\"零开销抽象\"]\n    SOME --&gt; HO[\"同构集合\"]\n    ANY --&gt; RC[\"运行时确定类型\"]\n    ANY --&gt; EC[\"存在容器开销\"]\n    ANY --&gt; HE[\"异构集合\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>some</code> 与 <code>any</code> 都是「隐藏具体类型」的机制，但隐藏的方式和代价截然不同——差异的根源在于<strong>类型在何时确定</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>some</code>（不透明类型）</strong>——对调用方隐藏具体类型，但具体类型在<strong>编译时</strong>即确定，且每次调用返回同一类型；编译器据此做静态分派，<strong>零运行时开销</strong>，并完整保留 <code>Self</code> 和关联类型能力；</li>\n<li><strong><code>any</code>（存在类型）</strong>——用<strong>存在容器</strong>在<strong>运行时</strong>持有任意遵循类型，支持异构集合，但需通过 witness table 间接分派并可能引入堆分配；</li>\n<li><strong>存在容器布局</strong>——固定 5 个机器字（40 字节），3 字值缓冲区（≤24 字节内联，超出堆分配）+ 元数据/VWT/PWT 指针；</li>\n<li><strong>协议装箱</strong>——SE-0335 起编译器可自动「打开」存在容器，把 <code>any</code> 传给接受 <code>some</code> 的函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong><code>some</code> 隐藏类型但保留静态性能，<code>any</code> 保留运行时灵活性但付出容器开销。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"some-不透明类型\">some：不透明类型</h2><p><code>some</code> 关键字声明返回类型是某个遵循指定协议的<strong>固定类型</strong>，但调用方不知道具体是哪个类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func makeShape() -&gt; some Shape {&#10;    Circle(radius: 10)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> makeShape</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Shape {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    Circle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">radius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>函数每次调用返回的<strong>必须是同一具体类型</strong></li>\n<li>编译器在编译时确定具体类型，<strong>无运行时开销</strong></li>\n<li>保留完整类型信息，支持 <code>Self</code> 要求和关联类型</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Animal: Equatable {&#10;    var name: String { get }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Dog: Animal {&#10;    let name: String&#10;}&#10;&#10;func makePet() -&gt; some Animal {&#10;    Dog(name: &quot;Buddy&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;let pet1 = makePet()&#10;let pet2 = makePet()&#10;let isEqual = pet1 == pet2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Animal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Equatable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Dog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Animal </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> makePet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Animal {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    Dog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Buddy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pet1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> makePet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pet2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> makePet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isEqual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pet1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pet2</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 上面代码可以正常编译，因为 <code>some Animal</code> 保留了底层类型 <code>Dog</code> 的 <code>Equatable</code> 能力。如果用 <code>any Animal</code> 则无法直接使用 <code>==</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"any-存在类型\">any：存在类型</h2><p><code>any</code> 关键字声明一个<strong>存在容器（Existential Container）</strong>，可以装入任何遵循指定协议的值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func processAnimals(_ animals: [any Animal]) {&#10;    for animal in animals {&#10;        print(animal.name)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;let pets: [any Animal] = [Dog(name: &quot;Buddy&quot;), Cat(name: &quot;Whiskers&quot;)]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processAnimals</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> animals: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Animal]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> animal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> animals {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(animal.name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pets: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Animal] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Dog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Buddy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Cat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Whiskers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>存在容器的内存布局：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;存在容器 Existential Container&quot;&#10;        VB[&quot;值缓冲区 (3 words)&quot;]&#10;        MD[&quot;元数据指针&quot;]&#10;        WT[&quot;协议见证表指针&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    VB --&gt;|小值内联| SV[&quot;直接存储值&quot;]&#10;    VB --&gt;|大值堆分配| HV[&quot;指向堆上值的指针&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"存在容器 Existential Container\"\n        VB[\"值缓冲区 (3 words)\"]\n        MD[\"元数据指针\"]\n        WT[\"协议见证表指针\"]\n    end\n    VB --&gt;|小值内联| SV[\"直接存储值\"]\n    VB --&gt;|大值堆分配| HV[\"指向堆上值的指针\"]</pre><p>存在容器固定占用 5 个机器字（40 字节 / 64 位），其中 3 个字用于值缓冲区。如果值超过 3 个字，则在堆上分配并在缓冲区中存放指针。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"some-vs-any-对比\">some vs any 对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th><code>some Protocol</code></th>\n<th><code>any Protocol</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型确定时机</td>\n<td>编译时</td>\n<td>运行时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能开销</td>\n<td>零（静态分派）</td>\n<td>存在容器 + 动态分派</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异构集合</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Self/关联类型</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n<td>受限（需要主关联类型）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回值类型</td>\n<td>所有返回路径类型一致</td>\n<td>可返回不同类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用场景</td>\n<td>API 返回值隐藏实现</td>\n<td>异构集合、依赖注入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// some：所有路径必须返回同一类型&#10;func makeView() -&gt; some View {&#10;    Text(&quot;Hello&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// any：可以存放不同类型&#10;var shapes: [any Shape] = [Circle(radius: 5), Square(side: 3)]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// some：所有路径必须返回同一类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> makeView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Hello\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// any：可以存放不同类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shapes: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Shape] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Circle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">radius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Square</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">side</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"协议装箱-protocol-boxing\">协议装箱（Protocol Boxing）</h2><p>SE-0335 引入了隐式的协议装箱（Implicit Opening of Existentials），允许将 <code>any</code> 类型传递给接受 <code>some</code> 的函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func describe(_ shape: some Shape) -&gt; String {&#10;    &quot;Area: \\(shape.area)&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;let myShape: any Shape = Circle(radius: 10)&#10;let description = describe(myShape)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shape: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Shape) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Area: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(shape.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">area</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> myShape: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Shape </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Circle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">radius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> description </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(myShape)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Swift 5.7 之前，上述代码无法编译。编译器现在会自动&quot;打开&quot;存在容器，提取内部的具体类型。</p>\n<p>装箱转换的流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Caller as 调用方&#10;    participant EC as 存在容器 (any)&#10;    participant Func as 泛型函数 (some)&#10;    Caller-&gt;&gt;EC: 传入 any Shape&#10;    EC-&gt;&gt;EC: 打开存在容器&#10;    EC-&gt;&gt;Func: 传入具体类型 Circle&#10;    Func-&gt;&gt;Func: 静态分派调用&#10;    Func-&gt;&gt;Caller: 返回结果\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Caller as 调用方\n    participant EC as 存在容器 (any)\n    participant Func as 泛型函数 (some)\n    Caller-&gt;&gt;EC: 传入 any Shape\n    EC-&gt;&gt;EC: 打开存在容器\n    EC-&gt;&gt;Func: 传入具体类型 Circle\n    Func-&gt;&gt;Func: 静态分派调用\n    Func-&gt;&gt;Caller: 返回结果</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能差异\">性能差异</h2><p><code>some</code> 和 <code>any</code> 在性能上的差异主要来自分派方式和内存布局：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Calculable {&#10;    func compute() -&gt; Double&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct LightCalc: Calculable {&#10;    let value: Double&#10;    func compute() -&gt; Double { value * 2 }&#10;}&#10;&#10;func useSome(_ c: some Calculable) -&gt; Double {&#10;    c.compute()&#10;}&#10;&#10;func useAny(_ c: any Calculable) -&gt; Double {&#10;    c.compute()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Calculable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LightCalc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Calculable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useSome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Calculable) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    c.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">compute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useAny</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Calculable) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    c.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">compute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th><code>some</code> 路径</th>\n<th><code>any</code> 路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>函数分派</td>\n<td>静态分派（内联）</td>\n<td>通过 witness table 间接调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存分配</td>\n<td>栈分配</td>\n<td>可能堆分配（值 &gt; 3 words）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>值拷贝</td>\n<td>直接拷贝</td>\n<td>通过 value witness 拷贝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译器优化</td>\n<td>可特化、内联</td>\n<td>优化受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在性能敏感的代码中优先使用 <code>some</code>。只在确实需要异构集合或运行时多态时使用 <code>any</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实际选择指南\">实际选择指南</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 优先使用 some：返回值类型隐藏&#10;func makeParser() -&gt; some Parser {&#10;    JSONParser()&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 需要 any：异构集合&#10;func allParsers() -&gt; [any Parser] {&#10;    [JSONParser(), XMLParser(), CSVParser()]&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 需要 any：存储属性类型未知&#10;class PluginManager {&#10;    var plugins: [any Plugin] = []&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 优先使用 some：函数参数&#10;func process(_ parser: some Parser, data: Data) throws {&#10;    try parser.parse(data)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 优先使用 some：返回值类型隐藏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> makeParser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Parser {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    JSONParser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 需要 any：异构集合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> allParsers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Parser] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSONParser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">XMLParser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CSVParser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 需要 any：存储属性类型未知</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PluginManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plugins: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Plugin] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 优先使用 some：函数参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parser: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Parser, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Data) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parser.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>**<code>some</code>（不透明类型）**在编译时确定具体类型，零运行时开销，适合返回值隐藏和函数参数</li>\n<li>**<code>any</code>（存在类型）**使用存在容器在运行时持有任意遵循类型，支持异构集合但有性能开销</li>\n<li>存在容器固定 5 个机器字，小值内联存储，大值堆分配</li>\n<li><strong>SE-0335</strong> 引入隐式打开存在容器，允许 <code>any</code> 到 <code>some</code> 的自动桥接</li>\n<li>性能敏感场景优先选择 <code>some</code>；需要运行时多态或异构存储时使用 <code>any</code></li>\n<li>SwiftUI 大量使用 <code>some View</code>，正是利用不透明类型的零开销特性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"不透明类型与存在类型","id":"不透明类型与存在类型"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"some：不透明类型","id":"some-不透明类型"},{"level":2,"text":"any：存在类型","id":"any-存在类型"},{"level":2,"text":"some vs any 对比","id":"some-vs-any-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"协议装箱（Protocol Boxing）","id":"协议装箱-protocol-boxing"},{"level":2,"text":"性能差异","id":"性能差异"},{"level":2,"text":"实际选择指南","id":"实际选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"关联类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/type-system/associated-types"},"next":{"title":"Result Builders 结果构建器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/type-system/result-builders"}}